# Every slide on the flat rail: cross it at a right angle (nose over the far side = Boardslide),
# then I + direction switches. Tailslide and Nosebluntslide turn the nose back over the approach
# side (a bluntslide's nose is over the far side, its tail down at the edge and the back wheels
# hooked over), so the plain switch after them is a Lipslide.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -7 1.4 0.14 0
hold up 6..80
hold ollie 70..90
tap grind 128
tap grind+up 150
tap grind+down 172
tap grind 194
tap grind+down+left 216
tap grind+up+left 238
tap grind 260
bot balance
run 500
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Boardslide,slide=true} within 129..130
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Noseslide,slide=true} within 151..152
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Tailslide,slide=true} within 173..174
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Lipslide,slide=true} within 195..196
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Bluntslide,slide=true} within 217..218
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Nosebluntslide,slide=true} within 239..240
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Lipslide,slide=true} within 261..262
expect no event bail
